All census data is originally from the U.S. Census Bureau. (https://www.census.gov/about.html).

2020 CVAP data was disaggregated to census blocks by Redistricting Data Hub. (https://redistrictingdatahub.org/data/about-our-data/american-community-survey/#cvap). License: https://redistrictingdatahub.org/terms-and-conditions/.

